              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho malaika owomusanvu yaafuuwa eigwala lye. Ghaabaagho amamiro mu igulu nga gakoba gati: “Obwakyabazinga obw'ensi bufuuse bwa Musengwa waife era bwa Kurisito: aidha kufuganga ebyanda n'ebyanda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.15"
            ]
          }
